Stonic AI — subscription edition (Gen 3).

Ye file jaan bujh kar yahan hai. Gen 3 aur Gen 2 (lifetime, v1.0.58) ka naam,
exe aur install folder bilkul EK jaisa hai — kyunke customer ko dono jagah wohi
brand dikhna chahiye, "Stonic AI 3" nahi.

To phir dono mein farq kaise kiya jaye? Isi file se.

Installer aur repair/cleanup scripts ye file dekh kar tay karte hain ke koi
folder "hamara" hai ya Gen 2 ka. Naam par bharosa nahi kiya ja sakta — dono ka
naam ek hai. Is file ke baghair installer Gen 2 ke folder ko apna samajh kar
uske upar chadh jata, aur 347 lifetime customers ki app mit jati.

ISAY DELETE YA RENAME MAT KAREIN.
